{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>gorepunk</strong> is a bloody\u00a0hopeful eco-punk RPG where recycling is religion, and humanity thrives in the corpse of a dead titan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a unique world of blood, guts and hope as you navigate the unliving god-city of Markoth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/gorepunk01.gif?t=1743428195\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a deep dialogue system with impactful choices affecting relationships, locations, and quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/gorepunk03.gif?t=1743428195\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Utilize a TTRPG-inspired ability and dice roll system to manage your daily actions and resources.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/gorepunk02.gif?t=1743428195\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge deep connections with a diverse cast, and spend influence to impact their lives and unlock new areas.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/gorepunk06.gif?t=1743428195\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623700?t=1743428195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623700?t=1743428195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/b276842d21d1d1bbd32ee6b8022dc0b4d83fb2fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743428195","